#: .\events\templates\between.html:4
msgid "PizzaPitch - pitch nights in Tashkent"
msgstr "PizzaPitch — Toşkentdagi pitch keçalari"

#: .\events\templates\between.html:8
msgid "Pitch nights<br><em>over pizza.</em>"
msgstr "Pitch keçalari<br><em>pitsa ustida.</em>"

#: .\events\templates\between.html:9
msgid ""
"PizzaPitch is a recurring evening in Tashkent where founders show their "
"product to a live audience, and guests meet the people building and "
"investing."
msgstr ""
"PizzaPitch — Toşkentda muntazam ötkaziladigan keça, bunda asosçilar öz "
"mahsulotini jonli tomoşabinlarga namoyiş etadi, mehmonlar esa loyihalarni "
"yaratuvçilar va investorlar bilan tanişadi."

#: .\events\templates\between.html:12
msgid "pitches per night"
msgstr "keçasiga pitchlar"

#: .\events\templates\between.html:13
msgid "minutes on stage"
msgstr "sahnadagi daqiqalar"

#: .\events\templates\between.html:14
msgid "Lots"
msgstr "Köplab"

#: .\events\templates\between.html:14
msgid "slices of pizza"
msgstr "pitsa bölaklari"

#: .\events\templates\between.html:18
msgid "Get notified about the next night"
msgstr "Keyingi keça haqida xabar oling"

#: .\events\templates\between.html:19
msgid ""
"Leave your email and we'll write when registration opens. No spam, just "
"dates."
msgstr ""
"Email manzilingizni qoldiring, röyxatdan ötiş oçilganda sizga yozamiz. Spam "
"yöq, faqat sanalar."

#: .\events\templates\between.html:24
msgid "Notify me"
msgstr "Menga xabar bering"

#: .\events\templates\between.html:32
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "Qanday işlaydi"

#: .\events\templates\between.html:35
msgid "Ten startups"
msgstr "Ön startap"

#: .\events\templates\between.html:35
msgid ""
"Selected from applications. Three minutes to pitch, seven for audience "
"questions."
msgstr ""
"Arizalar orasidan tanlanadi. Pitch uçun uç daqiqa, tomoşabinlar savollari "
"uçun yetti daqiqa."

#: .\events\templates\between.html:39
msgid "Guests & networking"
msgstr "Mehmonlar va networking"

#: .\events\templates\between.html:39
msgid ""
"Investors, founders, mentors, and anyone curious. We hang out over pizza."
msgstr ""
"Investorlar, asosçilar, mentorlar va qiziquvçi har kim. Pitsa ustida muloqot"
" qilamiz."

#: .\events\templates\between.html:43
msgid "Participation by approval"
msgstr "Tasdiqlaş orqali qatnaşiş"

#: .\events\templates\between.html:43
msgid ""
"Every application is reviewed manually. Free for guests, paid for startups."
msgstr ""
"Har bir ariza qölda körib çiqiladi. Mehmonlar uçun bepul, startaplar uçun "
"pullik."

#: .\events\templates\between.html:48 .\events\templates\index.html:60
#: .\events\templates\index_women.html:56
msgid "FAQ"
msgstr "Savol-javob"

#: .\events\templates\between.html:49
msgid "When's the next event?"
msgstr "Keyingi tadbir qaçon?"

#: .\events\templates\between.html:49
msgid ""
"We announce dates in advance. Leave your email above and we'll write as soon"
" as registration opens."
msgstr ""
"Sanalarni oldindan e'lon qilamiz. Yuqorida email manzilingizni qoldiring, "
"röyxatdan ötiş oçilgani hamon sizga yozamiz."

#: .\events\templates\between.html:50
msgid "How do I get in with my startup?"
msgstr "Startapim bilan qanday qatnaşaman?"

#: .\events\templates\between.html:50
msgid ""
"When registration is open, you apply through the site. We review manually "
"and reply by email within 24–48 hours."
msgstr ""
"Röyxatdan ötiş oçiq bölganda, sayt orqali ariza topşirasiz. Biz qölda körib "
"çiqamiz va 24–48 soat içida email orqali javob beramiz."

#: .\events\templates\between.html:51 .\events\templates\index.html:64
msgid "How much does it cost?"
msgstr "Narxi qança?"

#: .\events\templates\between.html:51
msgid ""
"Free for guests. For startups, participation is paid: this covers your spot "
"in the pitch session. The application is free; payment is requested only "
"after approval."
msgstr ""
"Mehmonlar uçun bepul. Startaplar uçun qatnaşiş pullik: bu pitch "
"sessiyasidagi örningizni qamrab oladi. Ariza topşiriş bepul; tölov faqat "
"tasdiqlangandan keyin söraladi."

#: .\events\templates\contacts.html:10
msgid ""
"Applicants and waitlist subscribers — kept for future outreach (e.g. new-"
"event announcements)."
msgstr ""
"Arizaçilar va kutiş röyxati obunaçilari — kelajakdagi murojaatlar uçun "
"saqlanadi (masalan, yangi tadbir e'lonlari)."

